      "flags": {},
      "order": 0,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Start here",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## PW Color Tools \u2014 basic chain\n\nReplace **Load Image** with your **VAE Decode** to grade a generation.\n\nOrder matters:\n\n1. **Match source** repairs VAE colour drift *before* anything creative.\n2. **Look** then **Curves** set the grade. Both bake to a LUT.\n3. **Optics** then **Grain** are last: spatial, and grain must not be filtered.\n4. **Scopes** passes through, so it can sit anywhere.\n\nEvery node: right-click or the `reset` chip returns it to pass-through.\nHold **Alt** over a preview to compare against the input."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
